 your dream house. There is plenty to do in this fun game. So what are you waiting for? Join the fun!\nDog Park VR strives to be different; for example, its art style gives the game character and makes it a fun escape from reality where every dog is happy. You can customize your dog to be whatever you want, and you can play with others whenever and wherever you want.", "short_description": "Dog Park VR lets you be a dog and play carefree. The game has many game modes; one second you're in space, then you're building your dream house. There is plenty to do in this fun game. So what are you waiting for? Join the fun!"}]}, "developer_name": "Electric", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mep478/dog-park-stuff/main/privacy%20policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Electric", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/dogparkvr/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "821934236779161"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "29899611343020748"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307420_1162485395638280_6944087713918222057_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rmUIMAJEJT8Q7kNvwG3qPP0&_nc_oc=AdqT6iM4gvZKgcZ_p-4-SwX20QGtLn__es-fQvTDyzCLJNv_cp_ovKBlCHbQyLrjUfU&_nc_zt